Methodological sources
----------------------
The skills cite published methodological literature by author and year the way
any research text does. Citing a method is not use of a licensed work: PRISMA,
CONSORT, COREQ, STROBE and the Citation Style Language are open standards, and
the books and articles named in the reference files are cited, never reproduced.

Style specifications
--------------------
APA, ASA, APSA, Chicago, MLA and GB/T 7714-2015 are style specifications
published by their respective bodies. The patterns in this plugin are
descriptions of publicly documented formatting rules, illustrated with original
examples. No style manual text is reproduced.

Runtime dependencies
--------------------
The optional diagram scripts import matplotlib (PSF/BSD-compatible) and networkx
(BSD 3-Clause). Neither is bundled; both are the user's own installation.
